{"seq":2,"slug":"offline-shadow-replay","title":"离线回放与影子双跑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/traffic-capture-replay/offline-shadow-replay","wordCount":2360,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"离线回放与影子双跑\">离线回放与影子双跑</h1><p>拿到一批可回放的请求记录之后，下一步是让它们「真的再跑一遍」。这个动作听起来只是发请求，但工程上真正的难点不在发送，而在三件事：怎么在不影响线上集群的前提下跑，怎么让新旧两套版本面对<strong>同一份</strong>数据，以及怎么在一次回放里同时拿到两个版本的结果用于对比。「离线回放」和「影子双跑」是这条光谱上的两个端点，前者追求完全隔离与可重复，后者追求真实链路与零复制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种执行模型的取舍\">核心概念：两种执行模型的取舍</h2><p><strong>离线回放</strong>把请求记录读出来，逐条打向一个独立部署的被测集群。被测集群使用索引快照（snapshot）挂载，与线上完全隔离。它的优势是可重复——同一批请求跑两次结果应当一致；劣势是它测的是一条「近似线上」的链路，缓存状态、近实时（NRT）刷新时机、副本分布都跟线上不同。</p>\n<p><strong>影子双跑</strong>（shadow / dark launch）让真实线上请求同时打向新旧两个集群，主链路的结果正常返回给用户，影子链路的结果只落盘不返回。它的优势是链路真实——分片、副本、缓存、并发度全部一致；劣势是它无法测「未来」的索引（影子集群的数据必须和线上同步），且会带来实打实的双份资源开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>离线回放</th>\n<th>影子双跑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>查询日志快照</td>\n<td>实时线上流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被测环境</td>\n<td>独立集群 + 索引快照</td>\n<td>与线上同数据的新集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重复性</td>\n<td>高（可冻结一切变量）</td>\n<td>低（依赖实时数据状态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源成本</td>\n<td>一次性、可控</td>\n<td>持续、双份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否测索引结构变更</td>\n<td>能（快照可重建）</td>\n<td>不能（数据必须对齐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否测容量/并发特性</td>\n<td>弱（需自己造压）</td>\n<td>强（真实并发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>排序/相关性/参数变更</td>\n<td>引擎版本/查询改写变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择的关键判据是<strong>被测变更是否改变了索引本身</strong>。如果变更动的是排序函数、查询改写逻辑、聚合参数，索引不变，两种方式都行，影子双跑的保真度更高。如果变更动的是索引 mapping、分析器、字段结构，索引必须重建，那只能用离线回放——因为影子集群没法在保持与线上数据一致的同时用上新索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线回放-从快照到可重复执行\">离线回放：从快照到可重复执行</h2><p>离线回放的可重复性来自三个「冻结」：冻结数据、冻结时间、冻结配置。数据冻结用索引快照实现，把线上某个时刻的索引原样恢复到被测集群；时间冻结靠回放器把每条记录里的 <code>runtime.now_ms</code> 注入进去，而不是用回放机器的当前时间；配置冻结意味着被测集群的几乎所有可调参数都在一次回放期间锁定，任何改动都会让本次结论作废。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 从线上快照仓库恢复一份索引到被测集群（不接触线上集群）&#10;curl -X POST &quot;http://replay-cluster:9200/_snapshot/prod_repo/products_v42/_restore?wait_for_completion=false&quot; \\&#10;  -H &#39;Content-Type: application/json&#39; -d &#39;{&#10;    &quot;indices&quot;: &quot;products_v42&quot;,&#10;    &quot;ignore_unavailable&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;include_global_state&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;rename_pattern&quot;: &quot;products_(.+)&quot;, &quot;rename_replacement&quot;: &quot;replay_products_$1&quot;&#10;  }&#39;&#10;&#10;# 2. 等待恢复完成（绿/黄都接受，但必须等到 shard 全部 allocated）&#10;until curl -s &quot;http://replay-cluster:9200/_cluster/health/replay_products_v42&quot; | jq -e &#39;.active_shards_percent_as_number == 100&#39; &gt;/dev/null; do sleep 5; done&#10;&#10;# 3. 按冻结配置开跑&#10;replay-runner --source s3://replay-corpus/2026-09-26/ \\&#10;  --target http://replay-cluster:9200 \\&#10;  --index replay_products_v42 \\&#10;  --freeze-time-from-record \\&#10;  --concurrency 32 \\&#10;  --out ./results/run-2026-09-27T03/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 从线上快照仓库恢复一份索引到被测集群（不接触线上集群）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"http://replay-cluster:9200/_snapshot/prod_repo/products_v42/_restore?wait_for_completion=false\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"indices\": \"products_v42\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"ignore_unavailable\": false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"include_global_state\": false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"rename_pattern\": \"products_(.+)\", \"rename_replacement\": \"replay_products_$1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 等待恢复完成（绿/黄都接受，但必须等到 shard 全部 allocated）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">until</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"http://replay-cluster:9200/_cluster/health/replay_products_v42\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.active_shards_percent_as_number == 100'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 按冻结配置开跑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replay-runner</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> s3://replay-corpus/2026-09-26/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://replay-cluster:9200</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --index</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> replay_products_v42</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --freeze-time-from-record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --out</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./results/run-2026-09-27T03/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--concurrency</code> 是这里唯一需要小心调的参数。并发太高会把被测集群压到队列溢出，延迟数字反映的是排队而不是检索计算；并发太低则测不出容量特性。稳妥做法是先用一个低并发跑完拿到「纯计算延迟」，再用目标并发跑一次拿到「包含排队的延迟」，两个数字分开看——这个区分与 <a href=\"../perf-correctness-regression/latency-distribution-compare\">延迟分布回归（p50/p95/p99）</a> 里讲的区分同源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"请求批处理与结果归档\">请求批处理与结果归档</h3><p>回放器逐条发请求是浪费的——检索层支持 msearch（multi-search）批量接口，一次往返可以携带几十到上百个查询。批处理能显著降低回放耗时，但会改变并发形态与延迟度量：批量请求的网络开销被摊薄，单查询延迟不能直接从批量响应时间里拆出来。因此实践上要区分两个用途：<strong>正确性回放</strong>用大批量追求吞吐，<strong>延迟回放</strong>用小批量或单条追求真实的每查询延迟。</p>\n<p>每个查询的结果必须完整归档，而不只是归档一个「是否一致」的布尔值。原因在下一篇会展开：Diff 分析需要原始的结果集顺序、doc id、打分、总命中数、聚合桶，甚至结果文档的关键字段。回放器只存摘要，下游就没法做归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影子双跑-真实链路上的并行执行\">影子双跑：真实链路上的并行执行</h2><p>影子双跑的实现形态通常是在检索层加一个「影子客户端」：主客户端照常把请求发给线上集群并把结果返回，影子客户端把<strong>同一份</strong>请求（经过改写以保证可比性）异步发给影子集群，结果写入影子结果队列。这里有几个容易做错的点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影子请求必须与主请求等价但不完全相同\">影子请求必须与主请求等价但不完全相同</h3><p>完全等价意味着不能带任何会改变结果的差异，但有些差异是必须的：影子请求不能写缓存（否则污染线上缓存）、不能触发个性化写入、不做计费、超时必须独立设置。因此影子请求是「主请求的语义等价克隆 + 副作用剥离」，而不是字节级复制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户请求] --&gt; B[主客户端]&#10;  A --&gt; C[影子客户端]&#10;  B --&gt; D[线上集群]&#10;  C --&gt; E[影子集群]&#10;  D --&gt; F[结果返回用户]&#10;  D --&gt; G[(主结果日志)]&#10;  E --&gt; H[(影子结果队列)]&#10;  G --&gt; I[Diff 引擎]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[差异报告]&#10;  C -.-&gt;|超时/失败 静默丢弃| K[影子指标]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户请求] --&gt; B[主客户端]\n  A --&gt; C[影子客户端]\n  B --&gt; D[线上集群]\n  C --&gt; E[影子集群]\n  D --&gt; F[结果返回用户]\n  D --&gt; G[(主结果日志)]\n  E --&gt; H[(影子结果队列)]\n  G --&gt; I[Diff 引擎]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[差异报告]\n  C -.-&gt;|超时/失败 静默丢弃| K[影子指标]</pre><h3 id=\"影子集群的数据一致性\">影子集群的数据一致性</h3><p>影子双跑最容易翻车的地方是数据。如果影子集群的数据落后线上几秒（NRT 刷新延迟、写入管道积压），那么「影子结果少了三个商品」可能纯粹是因为这三个商品刚上架还没进影子索引。这类差异是<strong>假阳性</strong>，会淹没真正的回归信号。</p>\n<p>处理办法有两条：一是<strong>对齐刷新</strong>，在比对阶段通过 doc 的时间戳字段过滤掉影子集群尚未可见的文档，把无法判定的一致性交给下一轮；二是<strong>记录数据水位</strong>，让每条影子结果带上影子集群当时的可见水位（比如最大 <code>_seq_no</code> 或写入时间戳），比对时用这个水位判断差异是否可归因。代价是比对逻辑变复杂，收益是假阳性大幅下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影子回放的资源与熔断\">影子回放的资源与熔断</h3><p>影子链路吃掉的是双份的 CPU 和内存。必须给它独立的资源配额与熔断：影子 QPS 超过阈值时按比例抽样而不是全量转发；影子集群不健康时立即断开而不是拖慢主链路。一条铁律是<strong>影子链路的任何失败都不能影响主链路的延迟</strong>——异步发送、独立超时、独立线程池/连接池，三者缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双跑结果的配对与关联\">双跑结果的配对与关联</h2><p>无论走哪种模型，最终都要把「同一个请求的两个版本结果」配成对。配对键不能用请求序号（离线回放的顺序可能与线上不同），也不能只用查询文本（相同文本在不同上下文下结果不同）。正确做法是用 <a href=\"query-log-sampling-context\">查询日志采样与请求上下文重建</a> 里落盘的 <code>trace_id</code> 作为配对键，并在记录里额外写入一个 <code>replay_run_id</code> 区分不同的回放批次。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 配对后的差异明细表（回放结果落库形态）&#10;CREATE TABLE replay_diff (&#10;  replay_run_id   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  trace_id        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  baseline_ver    TEXT        NOT NULL,   -- 如 es-8.15.2 + ranking@v41&#10;  candidate_ver   TEXT        NOT NULL,   -- 如 es-9.1.0  + ranking@v42&#10;  query_hash      TEXT        NOT NULL,   -- 查询文本哈希，用于聚类&#10;  total_hits_base BIGINT,&#10;  total_hits_cand BIGINT,&#10;  added_docs      JSONB,                  -- 候选多出的 doc id（有序）&#10;  removed_docs    JSONB,                  -- 候选缺失的 doc id（有序）&#10;  rank_shift      JSONB,                  -- {doc_id, from, to} 列表&#10;  agg_delta       JSONB,                  -- 聚合桶差异&#10;  latency_base_ms NUMERIC, latency_cand_ms NUMERIC,&#10;  data_watermark  BIGINT,                 -- 影子集群可见水位，用于假阳性过滤&#10;  verdict         TEXT,                   -- same | benign | regress | unknown&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (replay_run_id, trace_id, baseline_ver, candidate_ver)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_diff_regress ON replay_diff (replay_run_id, verdict)&#10;  WHERE verdict = &#39;regress&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 配对后的差异明细表（回放结果落库形态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> replay_diff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  replay_run_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trace_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseline_ver    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 es-8.15.2 + ranking@v41</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  candidate_ver   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 es-9.1.0  + ranking@v42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  query_hash      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询文本哈希，用于聚类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_hits_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_hits_cand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  added_docs      JSONB,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 候选多出的 doc id（有序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  removed_docs    JSONB,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 候选缺失的 doc id（有序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rank_shift      JSONB,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {doc_id, from, to} 列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agg_delta       JSONB,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 聚合桶差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  latency_base_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, latency_cand_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_watermark  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 影子集群可见水位，用于假阳性过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verdict         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- same | benign | regress | unknown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (replay_run_id, trace_id, baseline_ver, candidate_ver)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_diff_regress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_diff (replay_run_id, verdict)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'regress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>verdict</code> 字段不是回放器填的，而是 Diff 引擎判定的结果——把它放进同一张表是为了让「回放批次」成为一个自洽的审计单元，一次回放的所有证据都在一个可查询的边界里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回放规模的估算\">回放规模的估算</h2><p>回放耗时是团队最常低估的一项。一个可用的估算式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>replay</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>cache miss</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>restore</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{replay}} \\approx \\frac{N \\cdot (1 + r_{\\text{cache miss}})}{Q_{\\text{effective}}} + T_{\\text{restore}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">replay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cache miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">restore</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是待回放查询数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>cache miss</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{cache miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cache miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是回放时缓存未命中造成的额外代价系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{effective}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被测集群在目标延迟下能承受的有效 QPS，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>restore</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{restore}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">restore</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是索引恢复时间。索引恢复往往是主导项：一个 TB 级索引从快照恢复到可查询状态可能需要几十分钟到数小时，而回放本身可能只要十几分钟。这解释了为什么成熟团队会把「恢复快照」这一步做成常驻的预热集群，而不是每次回放都从零恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>离线回放以索引快照 + 时间冻结 + 配置冻结换取可重复性，是索引结构/分析器类变更的唯一选择；影子双跑以真实链路 + 实时数据换取保真度，适合排序与查询改写类变更。</li>\n<li>影子请求是「语义等价克隆 + 副作用剥离」，不能字节级复制（缓存污染、计费、个性化写入都要剥掉）。</li>\n<li>数据一致性是影子双跑假阳性的主要来源，需用水位对齐与差异归因过滤。</li>\n<li>配对键必须是 <code>trace_id</code> 而不是序号或查询文本；每次回放用一个 <code>replay_run_id</code> 圈出审计边界。</li>\n<li>回放耗时由索引恢复主导，常驻预热集群比按需恢复更实用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>修正回放中残余的不确定性（时间、个性化、随机性）是下一篇 <a href=\"replay-determinism-time\">回放确定性与时间/个性化处理</a> 的主题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"离线回放与影子双跑","id":"离线回放与影子双跑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种执行模型的取舍","id":"核心概念-两种执行模型的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"离线回放：从快照到可重复执行","id":"离线回放-从快照到可重复执行"},{"level":3,"text":"请求批处理与结果归档","id":"请求批处理与结果归档"},{"level":2,"text":"影子双跑：真实链路上的并行执行","id":"影子双跑-真实链路上的并行执行"},{"level":3,"text":"影子请求必须与主请求等价但不完全相同","id":"影子请求必须与主请求等价但不完全相同"},{"level":3,"text":"影子集群的数据一致性","id":"影子集群的数据一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"影子回放的资源与熔断","id":"影子回放的资源与熔断"},{"level":2,"text":"双跑结果的配对与关联","id":"双跑结果的配对与关联"},{"level":2,"text":"回放规模的估算","id":"回放规模的估算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询日志采样与请求上下文重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/traffic-capture-replay/query-log-sampling-context"},"next":{"title":"回放确定性与时间/个性化处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/traffic-capture-replay/replay-determinism-time"}}